{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track and hunt bunnies in the woods with your bow. It\u2019s what the King demands.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/87fbfefcf112e4803749ad8fbb17f082.poster.avif?t=1767848745\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/87fbfefcf112e4803749ad8fbb17f082.webm?t=1767848745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/87fbfefcf112e4803749ad8fbb17f082.mp4?t=1767848745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Load the catapult and hurl them into the castle. No one will thank you.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/4c8c73d98707a1c8e6ed009a0538d5bb.poster.avif?t=1767848745\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/4c8c73d98707a1c8e6ed009a0538d5bb.webm?t=1767848745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/4c8c73d98707a1c8e6ed009a0538d5bb.mp4?t=1767848745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Things tend to get stranger\u2026 and far more dangerous.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/6a2a9f9591ff10b0c2553a64c5c2fbf1.poster.avif?t=1767848745\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515620/extras/6a2a9f9591ff10b0c2553a64c5c2fbf1.webm?t=1